feat: Implement MeshTransport and RedisBus for Hybrid Teammate Mesh

This PR implements the requested `MeshTransport` interface in `src/server/msgbus.rs` which abstracts over either a `RedisBus` (for Cloud mode) or a `MemoryBus` (for Standalone mode). The implementation uses `rueidis` under the hood via the `redis` crate to satisfy the Cloud Teammate Mesh PUB/SUB capability requirements. It wires these transports up directly into the central `Hub` for real-time messaging orchestration.
